{"parse": {"title": "TTL-07", "pageid": 28157, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/TTL-06\" title=\"TTL-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TTL-07</span><a href=\"/wiki/TTL-08\" title=\"TTL-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TTL</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">07</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.A2.81.E5.A5.96.E8.BE.9E\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"颁奖辞\">颁奖辞</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 颁奖辞</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Award Speech</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1770307</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_bg_at_haidao\"><img alt=\"1_7_bg_at_haidao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png/600px-Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png/900px-Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>灯塔忠实地朝着四周播洒光亮，海浪一丝不苟地冲洗着沿岸的礁石，闹作一团、其乐融融的幽灵先生们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一阵海风久违地拂过了马库斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>眼前的一切都令她熟悉而恍惚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>先生们，你们……不再争吵了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-515401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-515401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-515401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马歇尔：</div><div>嘿，朋友们，瞧瞧谁来了——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>三人迅速地将马库斯围在中间，像是簇拥着一束终于盛开的花。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">唐纳德：</div><div>我……我还以为你不再愿意和我们当、当朋友了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>抱歉，先生们……整理新的几期《弗兰南群岛史》耗去的时间令我始料未及……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>但我总算将这几期稿件都寄给了丹尼希女士，希望这没有让她等待太久。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一双略微透明的手轻拍了拍马库斯的肩膀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜卡特：</div><div>我们都能理解你，小马库斯。创作可不是件轻松的事，否则，你也没法重新赢回读者们的心……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜卡特：</div><div>这可比在蒙特卡罗一掷千金要有勇气得多！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜卡特：</div><div>可你做到了，你取得了巨大的成功——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>杜卡特先生，您的话太夸张了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>马库斯紧张地缩了缩脖子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-515401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-515401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-515401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马歇尔：</div><div>我可以作证，老杜卡特说的半点儿也不夸张——噢，你一定没看最近的报纸，你的读者们又一次给你寄来了许多信！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">唐纳德：</div><div>但、但……这次，它们不可怕，它们很好……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一封封眼熟的信件又一次被递到了马库斯的手中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“很荣幸向您写下这样一封信，《弗兰南群岛史》、噢现在应该说是《到岛上来》的作者。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“我敬佩您的勇气，敬佩您敢于对自己所认可的故事进行大刀阔斧地修改……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“同样，我希望能向您表达祝贺。您写下了一个如此精彩的故事，尽管它的结局尚未发表，但它仍然在我心中留下难以忘怀的印象……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>故事……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她压下了短暂的疑惑，又接着读了下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“正因为有它们、有您的存在，我们才得以了解这令人陌生、而又充满惊喜与趣味的另一个世界。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“——一位苦苦等待下一节的热切读者”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>马库斯读完了信，小心翼翼地收起了不知从何而来的失落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">唐纳德：</div><div>不、不止这些……《白日梦邮报》也、也给你写了信……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">唐纳德：</div><div>“尊敬的马库斯小姐，我们很高兴地向您宣布，因为您的《到岛上来》，《白日梦邮报》的销售额获得了巨大的成功。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">唐纳德：</div><div>“读者们积极地向我们提议，他们希望能修改《到岛上来》的连载计划，建议我们每周出版两节以上的新内容。为此，出版社决定，为您的作品设立新的版面——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">唐纳德：</div><div>“——《灯塔故事集》！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">唐纳德：</div><div>“向您与您的幽灵朋友们致以最诚挚的问候。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>纷繁的褒赞之词从不同的信封中涌出，争先恐后地挤入了马库斯的眼中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她踉跄着退后，又缩回了那所小小的房间。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dengta_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dengta_ye\"><img alt=\"dengta_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-dengta_ye.png/600px-Cg-dengta_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-dengta_ye.png/900px-Cg-dengta_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-dengta_ye.png/1200px-Cg-dengta_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>来自于出版社编辑的热心提议始终映在她的脑海中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>《到岛上来》不再发表在“历史纪实”版面了吗……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她难以理解其中的深意，只好继续写了下去。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dengta_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dengta_ye\"><img alt=\"dengta_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-dengta_ye.png/600px-Cg-dengta_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-dengta_ye.png/900px-Cg-dengta_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-dengta_ye.png/1200px-Cg-dengta_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一页页新的稿纸寄出，一封封热情的信件寄回了这座岛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“一个完美的故事，调查员小姐与三位幽灵的友谊令人动容！”<br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“令人望而兴叹的神秘世界，下午茶时间最好的消遣……感谢您，您编写的故事集慷慨地给予了我长达数个清晨的欢笑！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“幽灵们的天赋让我嫉妒，神秘学家们写作故事的角度同样令人耳目一新。我期待着您更多古灵精怪的想象……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“我个人认为，本作值得入选年度百篇幻想故事之一……如果不符合标准，我们应该为之开设新的神秘学主题故事奖！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它们百般溢美，却又千篇一律。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一种巨大的惶恐折断了这支笔。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_bg_at_haidao\"><img alt=\"1_7_bg_at_haidao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png/600px-Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png/900px-Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>马库斯怔了怔神，耳边的讨论声又清晰了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-515401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-515401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-515401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马歇尔：</div><div>嘿，马库斯，你在想什么呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-515401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-515401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-515401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马歇尔：</div><div>你最近看起来都魂不守舍的，难道你也要变成像我们这样的幽灵了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜卡特：</div><div>别胡说八道，臭小子——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜卡特：</div><div>我们的大作家一定是累了，像你这样的文学白痴怎么能理解进行伟大创作的艰难呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他随意地撇了撇自己的胡须，为马库斯，也为自己骄傲着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜卡特：</div><div>马库斯，你写得真不错！连我都开始好奇后面我会发生些什么冒险了——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">唐纳德：</div><div>马、马库斯，你会一直写下去吗？……写这座岛、写我们……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>突如其来的疑问惊醒了她。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_at_chudengtaji3.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_at_chudengtaji3\"><img alt=\"1_7_at_chudengtaji3\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/Cg-1_7_at_chudengtaji3.png/600px-Cg-1_7_at_chudengtaji3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/Cg-1_7_at_chudengtaji3.png/900px-Cg-1_7_at_chudengtaji3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/Cg-1_7_at_chudengtaji3.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_at_chudengtaji3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>我……还会写下去吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>我希望凭借情节更曲折、内容更丰富的故事吸引更多的读者，我希望越来越多的人能逐渐理解神秘学，接受神秘学家……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>我希望有朝一日人们不分你我，能一同发掘最后的真相……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>我希望能够记录真相，盼望着更多读者的注目，更希望能与他们一同探索弗兰南群岛的谜团……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>可……能令他们动容的究竟是什么呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>是更曲折的情节、更惊奇的想象……还是更圆满的结局？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>马库斯恍惚地抬起头来，没去看周围满含期待的目光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>天空万里无云，她什么也没有读出来。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>《到岛上来》取得了重大的成功，这理应是件值得高兴的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>可，我却没能从这些褒奖中收获更多的喜悦……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对自我的质问戛然而止，一个早已清晰的答案停在了嘴唇边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>《到岛上来》成了一个构思精巧的虚构故事，成了一个虚无的谜题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>人们并不关心真相，也并不在乎真正的神秘学。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>凭借它，我便能靠近我的理想吗……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>这个故事的素材来源于杜卡特先生、唐纳德先生与马歇尔先生的真实经历，如果没有他们的讲述，我不可能写出这样好的文章……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>写作本身就更称不上是我的功劳了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>霍夫曼女士为我提供了帮助，她所教授的技巧促使《到岛上来》的改变，也使它收获了远超以往的正面评价……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>它们都与我无关。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>即使有一天，我穷尽了岛上的每一个角落，解释了其中所有的谜团。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>对读者来说，这也不过是一个精彩的故事终于迎来了理所当然的结尾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>……如此渺小的弗兰南群岛，能称作是我理想的全部么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>微不可闻的话语在马库斯的脑海里回荡，好似永无止息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它们愈发响亮，几乎要震破耳膜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>像是从内心深处生出的鸣响，像是来自更大舞台的遥遥呼唤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>汽笛声……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>——霍夫曼女士！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_at_chudengtaji1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_at_chudengtaji1\"><img alt=\"1_7_at_chudengtaji1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/Cg-1_7_at_chudengtaji1.png/600px-Cg-1_7_at_chudengtaji1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/Cg-1_7_at_chudengtaji1.png/900px-Cg-1_7_at_chudengtaji1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/Cg-1_7_at_chudengtaji1.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_at_chudengtaji1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不远处的汽笛声仍然鸣响着，灰白的帆不紧不慢地升了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306518.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306518.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306518.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306518.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306518.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306518.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306518.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306518.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>终稿在我的房间里，请帮我把它寄给丹尼希女士。拜托您了，杜卡特先生！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她头也不回地向海岸跑去，友人们疑惑的呼唤被远远地甩在了后面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜卡特：</div><div>嘿，小马库斯、未来的写作之星，咱们的好朋友，你这是要去哪——？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306518.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306518.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306518.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306518.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306518.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306518.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306518.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306518.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>再见，杜卡特先生……再见，唐纳德先生……再见，马歇尔先生！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_at_chudengtaji2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_at_chudengtaji2\"><img alt=\"1_7_at_chudengtaji2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/Cg-1_7_at_chudengtaji2.png/600px-Cg-1_7_at_chudengtaji2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/Cg-1_7_at_chudengtaji2.png/900px-Cg-1_7_at_chudengtaji2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/Cg-1_7_at_chudengtaji2.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_at_chudengtaji2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>困于岛上的姑娘终于迈开了步子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她不再回头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那些信封和稿纸一同飞扬起来，像是在挥手送别。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>请、请等等我，霍夫曼女士——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>眼前的船变得越发庞大，连同着那抹略显讶异的灰白身影也越发清晰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">霍夫曼：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>霍夫曼女士，我要加入基金会！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>或许，这是我第一次做出属于自己的决定。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_bg_at_wutai.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_bg_at_wutai\"><img alt=\"1_7_bg_at_wutai\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/Cg-1_7_bg_at_wutai.png/600px-Cg-1_7_bg_at_wutai.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/Cg-1_7_bg_at_wutai.png/900px-Cg-1_7_bg_at_wutai.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/Cg-1_7_bg_at_wutai.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_bg_at_wutai.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>可为什么……我会突然想起来它呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>这明明、是很久以前的事了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>视线逐渐清晰，翻倒的座椅、倾覆的幕布暗示着眼下故事的真正结局。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>……我当时为什么要那么做呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>我……究竟又为什么要来到这儿呢？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TTL-07"}}